[l_english.EQUIPMENT_RANGED_HANDGONNE]
Hoofgonne (Infantry)

[l_english.EQUIPMENT_RANGED_HANDGONNE_desc]
Just remember, handling a hoofgonne requires a steady hoof and a firm grip on reality, as it tends to have a mind of its own. So, saddle up, my friend, load your hoofgonnes with those tiny but mighty projectiles, and let the fireworks begin!
§g“...because nothing says ‘friendship is magic’ like a good ol’ gunpowder-powered blast to the face!”§!

[l_english.EQUIPMENT_RANGED_HANDGONNE_short]
Hoofgonne

[l_simp_chinese.EQUIPMENT_RANGED_HANDGONNE]
火铳 (步兵装备)

[l_simp_chinese.EQUIPMENT_RANGED_HANDGONNE_desc]
请记住，使用火铳需要稳健的蹄子和对现实的把握，因为它往往有自己的想法。但是，当你拥有毁灭地方的力量时，一点不可预测性又算得了什么呢？所以，我的朋友，准备好你的马鞍，装上那些小巧却威力无穷的弹丸，让焰火开始吧！
§g“...因为没有什么比用火器轰击对方的脸更加能诠释‘友谊是魔法’了！”§!

[l_simp_chinese.EQUIPMENT_RANGED_HANDGONNE_short]
火铳
